    <item>
      <title>第九届华中-华东地区生物信息学研讨会</title>
      <link>https://jacklingroup.github.io/gallery/2025.03/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 30 Mar 2025 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://jacklingroup.github.io/gallery/2025.03/</guid>
      <description>&lt;!-- Slides can be added in a few ways:

